{"id":"wb-7-1708","name":"无锡县商会旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"无锡县商会旧址","text":"无锡县商会旧址位于中国江苏省无锡市崇安区站前商贸区。\n\n现存两幢建于1915年的办公楼，均为两层的砖木结构建筑，外立面采用青红色相间的清水砖墙，入口处饰有西式砖雕柱子。该建筑在1949年4月商会终止活动后。曾长期作为居民楼使用，但楼梯、窗户、地板等尚保持原样。\n\n该建筑为无锡较有代表性的民族工商业历史遗存之一，并列入首批工业遗产保护名录。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E9%94%A1%E5%8E%BF%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":84956854,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84956854","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a189e63fe3abcf93e9ed8449.jpg","title":"Model_of_Wuxi_Chamber_of_Commerce_2011-11.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Model_of_Wuxi_Chamber_of_Commerce_2011-11.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/Model_of_Wuxi_Chamber_of_Commerce_2011-11.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​无锡县商会旧址模型，陈列于无锡民族工商业博物馆。","width":320,"height":240},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}